118","ref":"info-processing-practical-2022-2-c-2","number":18,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">다음 C 프로그램의 출력 결과를 쓰시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-c\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\nint len(char* p);\nint main(){\n  char* p1 = \"2022\";\n  char* p2 = \"202207\";\n  int a = len(p1);\n  int b = len(p2);\n  printf(\"%d\", a + b);\n}\nint len(char* p){\n  int r = 0;\n  while(*p != '\\0'){\n    p++;\n    r++;\n  }\n  return r;\n}</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"10","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["c","pointer","포인터 문자열 길이 함수"],"round_no":2,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2022년 2회","card_label":null,"year":2022,"part":null,"unit_no":9,"unit_name":"C언어","group_key":"lang-c","group_name":"C언어"},{"id":"84dac3244c28e214f75f8d95","unit_id":"330331701cdca0278079d6c7","ref":"info-processing-practical-2022-2-java-2","number":19,"type":"서술형","points":5,"body_html":"<div class=\"q-text\">다음 Java 프로그램의 출력 결과를 쓰시오.</div><pre class=\"qcode\"><code class=\"language-java\">public class Conv {\n  int a;\n  public Conv(int a) {\n    this.a = a;\n  }\n  int func() {\n    int b = 1;\n    for (int i = 1; i &lt; a; i++) {\n      b = a * i + b;\n    }\n    return a + b;\n  }\n}\n\npublic static void main(String[] args){\n  Conv obj = new Conv(3);\n  obj.a = 5;\n  int b = obj.func();\n  System.out.print(obj.a + b);\n}</code></pre>","choices":[],"answer_no":null,"answer_text":"61","answer_aliases":[],"answer_num":null,"round_digits":null,"tolerance":null,"dataset":null,"model":null,"code":null,"code_lang":null,"keywords":["java","advanced","생성자와 인스턴스 메서드"],"round_no":2,"round_label":"정보처리기사 실기 2022년 2회","card_label":null,"year":2022,"part":null,"unit_no":10,"unit_name":"Java","group_key":"lang-java","group_name":"Java"},{"id":"3dc6ed85ca075f5a923fabce","unit_id":"bb0d3f46525805dfcc917118","ref":"info-processing-practical-2022